SARS-CoV-2 Seasonality Manuscript Analyses Overview

This R script contains the full analysis pipeline for a manuscript examining SARS-CoV-2 seasonal transmission dynamics across 10 U.S. states.
It implements a compartmental mechanistic two-tier SEIRS-V model (Susceptible–Exposed–Infectious–Recovered–Vaccinated) ODE system with 10 compartments (S, E, I, R, V for each of two immunity tiers) to ten US states and generates all manuscript figures.

Study States
GA, MI, MN, NY, OH, TN, CA, CO, OR, UT

